@startuml
title PositionKind representation and one-dispatch-per-edge variant seam

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #E0F2FE
  BorderColor #075985
  ArrowColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  BorderColor #B45309
  FontColor #451A03
}

class "Algorithm\n(runtime API)" as Algorithm #FCE7F3 {
  Standard
  Transposition
  MergeAndSplit
}
class "VariantSpec\n(edge selector)" as VariantSpec #EDE9FE {
  Standard
  Osa
  MergeSplit
}
interface "AutomatonVariant" as Variant #DCFCE7 {
  successors(position, cv, ctx, out)
  epsilon_successors(position, ctx, out)
  subsumes(lhs, rhs, ctx)
  finish_cost(position, query_length, params)
  skip_window(position, ctx)
}
class StandardV #D1FAE5
class OsaV #DBEAFE
class MergeSplitV #FFEDD5
class "Position — 24 bytes on 64-bit" as Position #E0F2FE {
  + term_index: usize [8]
  + num_errors: usize [8]
  - kind: PositionKind [1]
  - aux: u8 [1]
  - padding [6]
  + kind()
  + aux()
  + is_special()
}
enum PositionKind #F1F5F9 {
  Normal
  OsaTransposing
  Splitting
  AffineQueryGap
  AffineDictGap
  DamerauPending
}
class "transition_state_inner<U,P,V>" as Kernel #CCFBF1 {
  one immutable TransitionCtx
  epsilon_closure_mut<V>
  State::insert_with<V>
}

Algorithm --> VariantSpec : select once\nper dictionary edge
VariantSpec --> Kernel : with_variant!
Kernel --> Variant : static calls\ninside position loop
Variant <|.. StandardV
Variant <|.. OsaV
Variant <|.. MergeSplitV
Kernel --> Position : reads / emits
Position *-- PositionKind

note right of Position
  Full sort key:
  (term_index, num_errors, kind, aux)

  Private tags prevent invalid
  continuation collisions.
end note
note bottom of Kernel
  No trait object and no public iterator generic.
  Runtime branch count per edge = 1.
end note
legend left
  |= Color |= Concept |
  |<#FCE7F3> pink | public runtime selector |
  |<#EDE9FE> violet | closed edge dispatch |
  |<#DCFCE7> green | proof/extension contract |
  |<#CCFBF1> teal | monomorphized hot kernel |
  |<#E0F2FE> blue | compact state representation |
endlegend
@enduml
